Z||000001||HugGRRRFiero||08-24-2000||10:23 AM||||  Are you running Internet Explorer, Netscape, or something else?   Check under preferences or internet options from the menus and check and see if your text/fonts sizes have changed...  Hope this helps<P>------------------<BR>     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/huggrrr.gif">   <BR>   <A HREF="mailto:HugGRRRFiero@hotmail.com">HugGRRRFiero@hotmail.com</A>  <p>[This message has been edited by HugGRRRFiero (edited 08-24-2000).]||||reg||1
Z||000002||1FST2M6||08-24-2000||01:23 PM||||ok internet ex 5.5... went into tools and internet options.. i can change the font style but not the size... on to plan b... anyone know what plan be might be... ||||reg||1
Z||000003||Monkeyman||08-24-2000||02:13 PM||||Easy.  Hold down the CTRL key as you operate your scroll wheel on your mouse.  You get 4 or 5 sizes to choose from.  I found this out by mistake one night.  Must have been tired and resting my hand on the keyboard.  Couldn't scroll, but sure did mess with my head.||||reg||1
