Z||000011||Cliff Pennock||08-24-2000||06:14 PM||||MM, just drag your toolbar to any side of the screen (click on an empty spot on your toolbar and while keeping the mouse button pressed, move your mouse to any side of your screen).<P>Finally - I was able to help someone...  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">||||reg||1
